# The game's screens outside play, for their pace on a real ST: boot, disk
# 2, the attract (logo, credits, high scores) left to run, fire to SELECT,
# fire to start: GET READY PLAYER 1. Logged from the attract's entry
# ($82D2): the VBL counter and the cycles into the VBL at every frame
# ($28D4, with its caller) and at its end ($2920).
stage flow-pace-enter.ini
stage shop-pace-frame.ini
stage shop-pace-done.ini
debug b pc = $82d2 :once :quiet :file {run}/flow-pace-enter.ini
sleep 20
disk-a {disk2}
sleep 60
fire
sleep 6
fire
sleep 20
shot game
